              "text": "At 10:58, Fallon Coatings deployed; by 11:11, warnings were issued for Brayle, expanding to Brayle and Sunder Flats by 11:12; Kellet Road was closed in Kellet Point industrial estate and Merrin Canal by 11:16; a mandatory evacuation was ordered for Brayle at 15:23, moving about 2,300 residents; by 20:09, about 300 people were displaced from Osmery.",
